Source: avaota-sun55i-cedar-codec
Section: non-free/video
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Local T527 Packaging <local-packaging@example.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), patchelf, gcc-aarch64-linux-gnu, binutils-aarch64-linux-gnu, xz-utils, pkgconf, make, python3
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: avaota-cedar-runtime
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libc6 (>= 2.17)
Description: Private common Allwinner Cedar runtime for Avaota A1
 Common VE, memory and support libraries from the local T527 Tina SDK.
 They use a package-specific directory and need the matching vendor kernel.

Package: avaota-cedar-encoder
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, avaota-cedar-runtime (= ${binary:Version}), libc6 (>= 2.17)
Description: Private Allwinner Cedar hardware encoder for Avaota A1
 H.264, H.265 and JPEG encoder libraries from the local T527 Tina SDK.

Package: avaota-cedar-decoder
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, avaota-cedar-runtime (= ${binary:Version}), libc6 (>= 2.17)
Description: Private Allwinner Cedar video decoder for Avaota A1
 Decoder frontend and format plugins from the local T527 Tina SDK.

Package: avaota-cedar-encoder-dev
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, avaota-cedar-common-dev (= ${binary:Version}), avaota-cedar-encoder (= ${binary:Version}), pkgconf
Description: Headers and pkg-config file for the Avaota Cedar encoder
 Local development files for linking applications to the private Cedar
 encoder runtime.

Package: avaota-cedar-decoder-dev
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, avaota-cedar-common-dev (= ${binary:Version}), avaota-cedar-decoder (= ${binary:Version}), pkgconf
Description: Headers and pkg-config file for the Avaota Cedar decoder
 Local development files for linking applications to the private Cedar
 decoder runtime.

Package: avaota-cedar-common-dev
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, avaota-cedar-runtime (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Shared Allwinner Cedar API headers for Avaota A1
 Common headers required by the Cedar encoder and decoder development files.

Package: avaota-cedar-media
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, avaota-cedar-runtime (= ${binary:Version}), avaota-cedar-encoder (= ${binary:Version}), avaota-cedar-decoder (= ${binary:Version}), libc6 (>= 2.17), libstdc++6, zlib1g, libatomic1, libasound2t64 | libasound2
Description: Private CedarX media libraries for Avaota A1
 Tina CedarX audio codec, container parser, muxer, playback and recording
 libraries. They use the private Cedar runtime and matching kernel ABI.

Package: avaota-cedar-ffmpeg
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libc6 (>= 2.17)
Description: Private FFmpeg multimedia tools and libraries for Avaota A1
 FFmpeg command-line tools and shared libraries built from upstream source.
 Native FFmpeg codecs are independent of the Cedar hardware API.
